**The Core Issue:**
There's a significant gap between the mediator's demonstrated capacity (evident in the debrief) and their actual performance (in the live mediation). This suggests either performance anxiety, over-reliance on technique, or insufficient presence. A truly emotionally intelligent mediator would bring the depth and humanity of the debrief into the live interaction.
